{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:612","content":{"id":612,"title":"二分图检测","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c576eacc-26ec-4152-8ce0-4c57b0b65f56","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么叫二分图"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2ddebd99-f215-4d61-b47d-ba30d4017271.webp","uuid":"f62b8682-9584-42f0-9171-f2132ef654e0","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2ddebd99-f215-4d61-b47d-ba30d4017271.webp","width":291.24998842676524,"naturalWidth":699,"naturalHeight":806,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"3538c763-1a81-4767-ab3d-2398dbc4fedd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"59b8049b-d216-40ad-ab70-e07e32832342","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"二分图需要满足一下两个特点："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"cf52f420-9a6e-4a6c-8217-d8baded85aa3","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ebd6e486-aa0f-416f-b7a6-ea2dcd2b5578","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"78c8d63a-70a4-4caa-8f67-c070e9ebdfb1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图中的节点被划分为两部分"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"27039fbe-eb6b-457e-a7e8-3c4de439e106","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"02f0f647-5c3f-4ff5-9a68-623a7a2778fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图中的边连接的是两个部分的节点"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bbee37cb-840a-4720-944e-0a9ea7f6915a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在上图中，节点 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0, 3, 4, 5","collabId":"b22b281d-55e7-45e2-a80b-a8f4a7101db0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0, 3, 4, 5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一部分，节点 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1, 2, 6","collabId":"240a60dc-65a2-4d31-a13e-b6e31b5fba44","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1, 2, 6"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一部分，两部分的节点我使用不同的颜色进行填充；且图中所有的边都连接的是两个部分的节点。很明显上面的图满足二分图的两个特点，所以上面的图是一个二分图，那接下来的问题是如何检测一个图是否是一个二分图呢?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3339552e-20d5-4d01-b772-eaf2a88d87ed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先明白下面两个图是等价的"}]},{"naturalWidth":1547,"naturalHeight":842,"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2d466ee5-4fb9-4fc4-b531-64cbe6b3df36.webp","uuid":"073645ca-a87c-46cf-9ee1-8597597d0d66","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2d466ee5-4fb9-4fc4-b531-64cbe6b3df36.webp","width":644.5833077198939,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c37e9493-a196-41f1-9b70-80f41d742817","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ef3d660c-8323-4d69-824b-d7b6a4f12c15","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是我们很难从右边的图中分辨出两部分的节点。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f0cdcea5-1331-42be-bae7-f95d3f0945b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决这个问题的关键是图中的所有边连接的是两个不同部分的节点，如果我们将对图进行深度优先遍历的过程中对节点染色，相同部分的节点染为一个颜色，因为所有的边都连接的是不同部分的节点，这意味着任意节点的邻接节点的颜色和自己都是不同的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2f67dbcc-53d4-4a2c-8251-e124cc951a7e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们在遍历时将所有邻接节点的颜色染为和自己不一样，但是如果邻接节点已经染色，并且染的颜色和自己相同，与二分图的定义冲突，那么说明不是一个二分图，反之邻接节点染的颜色和自己不同，则继续遍历，如果遍历完整个图时都没有冲突，那么说明这个图就是一个二分图"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20201028090157_c24914ad-773a-433f-b6e4-81c6217cba77_c913d8b3-e77c-4345-9437-aefd0bee3b45.gif","uuid":"5dba8235-4d91-4212-96b8-81e61f96aecf","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20201028090157_c24914ad-773a-433f-b6e4-81c6217cba77_c913d8b3-e77c-4345-9437-aefd0bee3b45.gif","width":545.8333116438662,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"da449e41-8bcb-45d6-8e17-c6ab0e26039b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1818d6c7-a559-4e3c-9240-25f2d7d6d4b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"代码如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"0d9b671d-871b-4c13-975d-4d7115859b9c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4b7617b6-dd79-4344-9255-3cee4e9b178d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.util.Arrays;\n\npublic class BinaryPartitionDetection {\n    private Graph graph;\n    private boolean[] visited;\n    // 以 0 1 表示不同颜色\n    private int[] colors;\n\n    // 表示该图是否为二分图\n    private boolean isBipartite;\n\n    public BinaryPartitionDetection(Graph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        visited = new boolean[graph.V()];\n        Arrays.fill(visited, false);\n        // 初始化 colors 为 -1，表示未染色\n        colors = new int[graph.V()];\n        Arrays.fill(colors, -1);\n\n        isBipartite = true;\n    }\n\n    public void dfs() {\n        for (int i = 0; i < visited.length; i++) {\n            if (!visited[i]) {\n                // 如果在某联通分量中检测到不是二分图，不需要检测其他联通分量\n                if (!dfs(i, 0)) {\n                    isBipartite = false;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private boolean dfs(int v, int color) {\n        visited[v] = true;\n        // 染色\n        colors[v] = color;\n        for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n            if (!visited[w]) {\n                // 0 => 1 - color = 1\n                // 1 => 1 - color = 0\n                // 如果已经在遍历某邻接节点的过程中检测到不是二分图，不需要遍历其他邻接节点\n                if (!dfs(w, 1 - color)) {\n                    return false;\n                }\n                // 进入 else if 表示该节点已经被访问过\n                // 如果该节点的颜色与它的邻接节点相同，说明不是二分图，后面节点无需遍历\n            } else if (colors[v] == colors[w]) {\n                return false;\n            }\n        }\n        return true;\n    }\n\n    public boolean isBipartite() {\n        return isBipartite;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Graph graph = new AdjSet(\"g3.txt\");\n        BinaryPartitionDetection binaryPartitionDetection = new BinaryPartitionDetection(graph);\n        binaryPartitionDetection.dfs();\n        System.out.println(binaryPartitionDetection.isBipartite()); // true\n    }\n}","collabId":"22e0bcac-f881-447d-b307-648286201e82","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ed0a016d-db6e-4399-a9b5-bedc660b9ceb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中 g3.txt 的内容如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"44d8b888-9e44-49a1-86e6-5e306ad7f3be","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"83e34890-1fe0-424c-8830-ef489488b517","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"7 6\n0 1\n0 2\n1 3\n2 4\n2 5\n4 6","collabId":"72510007-dbd8-4520-9b2b-aba404f0a943","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c6b36415-cbf6-4335-b8f1-9fa3a5a179cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所表示的图如下，与动图中的图相同"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6ad4bd43-df22-4143-a85d-9ba0e7a12a34.webp","uuid":"e22644ac-366d-480c-902c-c2fec86b19e2","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6ad4bd43-df22-4143-a85d-9ba0e7a12a34.webp","width":400.83331740564836,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"1d72b639-e9c9-4cf7-8e09-6fcac2490fd1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"177282e9-1194-47c1-9c14-492e51a5f5a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在上面的实现中也使用了提前终止的技术，使用该技术可以很方便的提前终止遍历，提高程序的性能。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"深度优先遍历","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:597","type":"doc","id":597}},{"label":"二分图检测","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:612","type":"doc","id":612}}],"prevPage":{"title":"无向图的环检测","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:611","type":"doc","id":611}},"nextPage":{"title":"岛屿的最大面积","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:615","type":"doc","id":615}},"createTime":1701959719442,"updateTime":1792104839081,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1792104839081}}